--[[
  Bonus chest auto-collect + NexusLib UI (window title: Summon Heroes).
  Game: parts tagged "BonusChestPart", ProximityPrompt under Attachment (BonusChests system).

  NexusLib: optional getgenv().NexusLibPath, then readfile("NexusLib.lua"), then GitHub URLs.
  Chests: TP in range, then executor fireproximityprompt (HoldDuration→0); falls back to E if no executor API.

  Re-run after server / lobby: uses queue_on_teleport (TeleportService). Optional:
    getgenv().BonusChestScriptUrl = "https://..."  -- override script URL
    getgenv().BonusChestNoQueue = true             -- skip queue_on_teleport
  Closing Roblox or losing connection cannot be hooked from Lua — use executor auto-execute.

  Settings file: BonusChests_config.json — toggles + queueOnTeleport. Ready: Systems.Waves.Ready. Vote: Systems.Voting.Vote.
  Story: when the MAP SELECTION screen is open, Auto start story selects WaveData map key + stage index, then clicks Start (same as MapList / StageList / StartButton).
  Optional: getgenv().BonusChestStoryMap = "VolcanoFortress"; getgenv().BonusChestStoryStage = 3
  Dungeons: RaidSelect UI — each stage is a MapList row named "Dungeon" with attribute StageNum (1–3). Same Start button in that ScreenGui.
  Optional: getgenv().BonusChestDungeonRaidKey = "Dungeon"; getgenv().BonusChestDungeonStage = 1

  Player tab (NexusLib): walk speed, infinite jump, anti-AFK (+ optional noclip / god / respawn).

  Promo: Systems.PromoCodes.ClaimCode:FireServer(code). Set list via:
    getgenv().BonusChestPromoCodes = { "CODE1", "CODE2" }  or edit PROMO_CODES_EDIT below.

  Item / PvP shops: Systems.RotatingShops — BuyItem:FireServer(shopKey, slotIndex). Uses game modules for stock + CanAfford.
  Filter: comma-separated ItemName ids (e.g. Cupcake,TraitReroll) or * for any in-stock item you can afford.
  Optional overrides: getgenv().BonusChestRotatingShopKey, getgenv().BonusChestRotatingShopFilter (comma list or * alone).

  Unit fusion: Systems.UnitFusion — PurchaseFuse:InvokeServer(mainUnit, {3× sacrifice}). Sacrifices must be in Profile.Inventory.Units (unequipped), same StarCount; main can be equipped or inventory. Game rules + coins/crystals enforced server-side.

  Summon: Systems.Summon — BuyPack:FireServer(packName, amount, "Gems"|"SummonTicket"); Mythic: BuyMythicBanner:FireServer().
  Auto-sell: Settings AutoSell_Rarity3..6 (same as SUMMON UI). After PackOpened, script sells matching units after a delay (summon animation).
  Optional: getgenv().BonusChestSummonPack = "Pack1"; BonusChestSummonAmount; BonusChestSummonCurrency; BonusChestSummonSellDelay (seconds).

  Stat reroll: Systems.UnitUpgrades — BuyStatReroll(player, unitFolder, lockedStatNames[]); then RerollAction(player, "UseNew"|"KeepCurrent"). Locks cost extra gold per stat.
  Optional: getgenv().BonusChestStatRerollUnit; BonusChestStatRerollMode ("always"|"better"); BonusChestStatRerollMaxRolls.

  Trait reroll: same UnitUpgrades — BuyTraitReroll(player, unit); confirm with TraitRerollAction or RerollAction("UseNew"|"KeepCurrent"). Until-goal mode keeps current trait if roll does not match comma-separated goals (substring).
  Optional: getgenv().BonusChestTraitRerollUnit; BonusChestTraitRerollGoals; BonusChestTraitRerollMode ("until_goal"|"always_apply"); BonusChestTraitRerollMaxRolls.

  Quests UI (Achievements / Daily): tries Systems.Quests|Achievements|Quest module ClaimAll* methods, then Systems.QuestEvent:FireServer(...). Server rejects invalid claims.
  Optional: getgenv().BonusChestClaimQuestsIntervalSec

  Player tab (NexusLib): walk speed slider + toggles persist to the same JSON when changed; re-open script restores them.
]]

